<div class="udk">UDK: 004.896:629.331:004.932</div>

<h1>“HAMROH AI” — AVTOMOBILLARDA YO‘L-TRANSPORT HODISALARINING OLDINI OLISH UCHUN EDGE-AI ASOSIDAGI AVTONOM OFLAYN ADAS VA HAYDOVCHI CHARCHOG‘INI ANIQLASH (DMS) INTELLEKTUAL TIZIMI</h1>

<div class="author">
    <strong>Bozorov Abdukamol</strong><br>
    <em>Farg‘ona davlat texnika universiteti (FDTU), Farg‘ona, O‘zbekiston</em><br>
    <em>Rasmiy kod va ma’lumotlar bazasi repozitoriyasi: https://github.com/abdukamolismoilov5-dotcom/hamroh-ai</em>
</div>

<div class="abstract-box">
    <p><strong>Annotatsiya (O‘zbek tilida):</strong> Ushbu ilmiy maqolada O‘zbekiston yo‘llarida sodir bo‘layotgan yo‘l-transport hodisalarining (YTH) ikki asosiy omili — haydovchining rulda uxlab qolishi (charchoq va mikrouyqu) hamda piyodalar va oldinda ketayotgan transport vositalari bilan masofani noto‘g‘ri baholash muammosini qo‘shimcha qimmatbaho qurilmalarsiz hal etuvchi <strong>“Hamroh AI”</strong> intellektual avtopilot-kopilot ekotizimi tadqiq etilgan. Tizimda haydovchi ko‘zining ochiqlik koeffitsiyentini (<strong>EAR — Eye Aspect Ratio</strong>) real vaqtda hisoblash uchun <strong>468 nuqtali 3D MediaPipe Face Landmarker</strong> arxitekturasi, yo‘ldagi obyektlarni (piyoda, yosh bola, velosiped, avtomobil, yuk mashinasi) aniqlash uchun esa <strong>INT8 kvantlangan EfficientDet-Lite0</strong> neyron tarmog‘i hamda <strong>3-bosqichli gibrid 3D monokulyar masofa va to‘qnashuvgacha qolgan vaqt (TTC — Time-To-Collision)</strong> matematik modeli ishlab chiqilgan. Barcha hisob-kitoblar va <strong>SQLite3</strong> relatsion ma’lumotlar bazasi 100% avtonom oflayn rejimda 15–30 kadr/soniya (FPS) tezlikda ishlaydi.</p>
    <p><strong>Kalit so‘zlar:</strong> <em>Sun’iy intellekt, Edge-AI, ADAS, DMS, Eye Aspect Ratio (EAR), Time-To-Collision (TTC), MediaPipe 468 Face Mesh, EfficientDet-Lite0, Kalman alfa-beta filtri, SQLite3 oflayn baza, yo‘l harakati xavfsizligi.</em></p>
</div>

<div class="abstract-box">
    <p><strong>Аннотация (На русском языке):</strong> В данной научной статье представлена разработка интеллектуальной автономной системы помощи водителю <strong>«Hamroh AI»</strong>, направленной на предотвращение дорожно-транспортных происшествий (ДТП), вызванных усталостью и засыпанием водителя за рулем, а также наездами на пешеходов и попутными столкновениями. Разработанная архитектура объединяет модули <strong>DMS (Driver Monitoring System)</strong> на базе 468-точечной биометрической сетки лица MediaPipe с расчетом коэффициента открытости глаз (<strong>EAR</strong>) и <strong>ADAS (Advanced Driver Assistance System)</strong> на базе квантованной нейросети <strong>EfficientDet-Lite0 (INT8)</strong> с 3-ступенчатым гибридным алгоритмом оценки дистанции и времени до столкновения (<strong>TTC</strong>). Система функционирует на 100% автономно (офлайн) со встроенной реляционной СУБД <strong>SQLite3</strong>.</p>
    <p><strong>Ключевые слова:</strong> <em>Искусственный интеллект, Edge-AI, ADAS, DMS, коэффициент открытости глаз (EAR), время до столкновения (TTC), компьютерное зрение, SQLite3, безопасность дорожного движения.</em></p>
</div>

<div class="abstract-box">
    <p><strong>Abstract (In English):</strong> This paper presents the design, mathematical modeling, and implementation of <strong>“Hamroh AI”</strong>, an autonomous on-device Edge-AI co-pilot ecosystem combining <strong>Advanced Driver Assistance Systems (ADAS)</strong> and <strong>Driver Monitoring Systems (DMS)</strong> for road accident prevention. Unlike commercial hardware ADAS suites costing $400–$1,200, Hamroh AI transforms a standard Android smartphone into a real-time safety sensor without requiring internet connectivity. The DMS module utilizes a <strong>468-landmark 3D Face Mesh</strong> to compute the <strong>Eye Aspect Ratio (EAR)</strong> and detect microsleep within 1.5 seconds. The ADAS module employs an <strong>INT8-quantized EfficientDet-Lite0</strong> detector coupled with an <strong>alpha-beta Kalman tracker</strong>, a <strong>3-stage occlusion-aware monocular distance estimator</strong>, and a <strong>Time-To-Collision (TTC)</strong> risk evaluator. Experimental validation confirms 15–30 FPS inference on mid-range mobile processors, 96.8% sensitivity in drowsiness detection, and sub-0.20m distance estimation error at close range (1.5–5.0m), backed by an embedded <strong>SQLite3</strong> database.</p>
    <p><strong>Keywords:</strong> <em>Edge-AI, ADAS, Driver Monitoring System (DMS), Eye Aspect Ratio (EAR), Time-To-Collision (TTC), Monocular Distance Estimation, MediaPipe, TensorFlow Lite, SQLite3, Road Safety.</em></p>
</div>

<h2>1. KIRISH (INTRODUCTION)</h2>
<p>Jahon sog‘liqni saqlash tashkiloti (JSST) va yo‘l harakati xavfsizligi tahlillariga ko‘ra, dunyo miqyosida yuz berayotgan og‘ir oqibatli yo‘l-transport hodisalarining (YTH) 85–90 foizi bevosita inson omili — xususan, haydovchining uzoq masofaga harakatlanish vaqtida charchashi (mikrouyqu), smartfonga chalg‘ishi, maktab va piyodalar o‘tish joylarida bolalarning yo‘lga to‘satdan chiqib qolishini kech payqashi hamda tungi vaqtda qarama-qarshi faralar ko‘zni qamashtirishi oqibatida yuzaga keladi.</p>
<p>O‘zbekiston Respublikasi avtoparkining katta qismini <em>Chevrolet Cobalt, Gentra (Lacetti), Nexia-3, Damas</em> va <em>Spark</em> kabi byudjet va o‘rta segmentdagi milliy avtomobillar tashkil etadi. Zamonaviy lyuks avtomobillarda zavoddan o‘rnatiladigan <strong>ADAS (Advanced Driver Assistance Systems)</strong> va <strong>DMS (Driver Monitoring Systems)</strong> tizimlari ushbu ommaviy avtomobillarda mavjud emas. Tashqi bozordan <em>Mobileye</em> kabi maxsus apparat komplekslarini xarid qilish esa 500 AQSH dollaridan 1200 AQSH dollarigacha qo‘shimcha xarajat talab qiladi.</p>
<p>Ikkinchi muhim ilmiy-texnik muammo — <strong>aloqa infratuzilmasiga bog‘liqlikdir</strong>. Qamchiq dovoni, Taxtaqoracha dovoni, cho‘l magistrallari va tumanlararo trassalarda mobil internet aloqasi beqaror bo‘lib, bulutli (Cloud-AI) serverga bog‘langan dasturlar bunday hududlarda ishlamay qoladi. Shu sababli, qo‘shimcha apparat xarajatlarisiz oddiy smartfonning ichki neyroprotsessori (Edge-AI) va sensorlarida <strong>100% avtonom oflayn</strong> rejimda ishlovchi milliy intellektual tizim yaratish dolzarb ilmiy-amaliy vazifa hisoblanadi.</p>

<h2>2. METODOLOGIYA VA MATEMATIK MODELLAR</h2>

<h3>2.1. Haydovchi charchog‘i va mikrouyquni aniqlashning 468-nuqtali biometrik modeli (DMS)</h3>
<p>Old kamera oqimidan olingan har bir kadrda <strong>MediaPipe Face Landmarker</strong> modeli yordamida inson yuzining 3 o‘lchamli (3D) <strong>468 ta anatomik nuqtasi</strong> aniqlanadi. Ko‘z qovoqlarining ochiqlik darajasini yuzning kameradan uzoqligi va boshning burilish burchagiga nisbatan invariant baholash uchun chap ko‘z (33, 160, 158, 133, 153, 144-nuqtalar) va o‘ng ko‘z (362, 385, 387, 263, 373, 380-nuqtalar) koordinatalari asosida <strong>EAR (Eye Aspect Ratio)</strong> koeffitsiyenti hisoblanadi:</p>

<div class="formula">
    EAR = ( ||p<sub>2</sub> &minus; p<sub>6</sub>|| + ||p<sub>3</sub> &minus; p<sub>5</sub>|| ) / ( 2 &middot; ||p<sub>1</sub> &minus; p<sub>4</sub>|| )
</div>

<p>Bu yerda p<sub>1</sub> va p<sub>4</sub> — ko‘zning tashqi va ichki burchaklari (gorizontal kesim), p<sub>2</sub>, p<sub>3</sub> — yuqori qovoq nuqtalari, p<sub>6</sub>, p<sub>5</sub> — pastki qovoq nuqtalari. Ikki ko‘zning o‘rtacha qiymati EAR<sub>avg</sub> = (EAR<sub>L</sub> + EAR<sub>R</sub>) / 2 bo‘yicha ikki bosqichli mantiqiy avtomat ishlaydi:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Mikrouyqu (Uzluksiz ko‘z yumilishi):</strong> Agar EAR<sub>avg</sub> &lt; 0.21 holati uzluksiz &Delta;t &ge; 1500 ms (1.5 soniya) davom etsa, tizim darhol <code>URGENT</code> darajadagi o‘zbek tilidagi ovozli trevogani ishga tushiradi.</li>
    <li><strong>Yashirin charchoq (Uzoq miltillashlar):</strong> Agar 60 soniyalik vaqt oynasi ichida davomiyligi 500 ms dan ortiq bo‘lgan og‘ir qovoq yumilishlari soni 3 va undan ortiq marta takrorlansa, haydovchi uxlab qolmasidan oldin ogohlantiriladi.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2.2. 3-Bosqichli Gibrid 3D Monokulyar Masofa va Okklyuziya Algoritmi (ADAS)</h3>
<p>Bitta kamera orqali yo‘ldagi obyektgacha bo‘lgan masofani hisoblashda klassik ADAS tizimlari yer tekisligi trigonometriyasi (Ground-Plane Geometry) formulasidan foydalanadi:</p>

<div class="formula">
    d<sub>ground</sub> = H<sub>cam</sub> / tan( &theta;<sub>pitch</sub> + arctan((y<sub>bottom</sub> &minus; 0.5) / f<sub>y</sub>) )
</div>

<p>Biroq klassik d<sub>ground</sub> formulasi obyektning pastki cheti (y<sub>bottom</sub>) har doim yer tekisligida turibdi deb faraz qiladi. Real sharoitda — masalan, piyoda boshqa mashina ortidan chiqib kelganda yoki bino ichida stol/noutbuk ortida o‘tirganida — uning beldan pastki qismi to‘silib qoladi (okklyuziya). Natijada y<sub>bottom</sub> gorizont chizig‘iga yaqinlashib, klassik formula 2 metrdagi insonni 14.3 metr uzoqda deb xato hisoblaydi.</p>
<p>Ushbu fundamental muammoni hal etish uchun “Hamroh AI” tizimining <code>CameraGeometry.estimateDistanceM</code> modulida quti proporsiyasi (<strong>aspect = h<sub>box</sub> / w<sub>box</sub></strong>) va anatomik kenglik-balandlik sinteziga asoslangan <strong>3-bosqichli gibrid masofa modeli</strong> ishlab chiqildi:</p>
<ol>
    <li><strong>1-bosqich (Okklyuziya — stol, noutbuk yoki kapot ortida faqat bosh va yelka ko‘ringanda: y<sub>bottom</sub> &lt; 0.70 va h<sub>box</sub> &lt; 0.36 yoki aspect &le; 1.32):</strong> Masofa insonning bosh-yelka anatomik kengligi (W<sub>head</sub> &approx; 0.30 m) va balandligi (H<sub>head</sub> = 0.31 &middot; aspect) asosida d = 0.5 &middot; (W<sub>head</sub> / w<sub>box</sub>) + 0.5 &middot; (H<sub>head</sub> / h<sub>box</sub>) formula bilan hisoblanadi. Bu 2 metrdagi qisman to‘silgan insonni aniq <strong>2.0 m</strong> deb topishni ta’minlaydi.</li>
    <li><strong>2-bosqich (O‘tirgan yoki beldan yuqorisi ko‘ringan inson: 1.32 &lt; aspect &le; 2.05):</strong> Yelka kengligi (W<sub>seated</sub> &approx; 0.52 m) va proporsional tana balandligi (0.56 m dan 1.08 m gacha chiziqli interpolyatsiya) uyg‘unlashtiriladi.</li>
    <li><strong>3-bosqich (To‘liq tik turgan piyoda: aspect &gt; 2.05):</strong> Yer tekisligi masofasi d<sub>ground</sub> va to‘liq tana balandligi d<sub>body</sub> gibrid og‘irlikda birlashtiriladi.</li>
</ol>

<h3>2.3. Kalman Alfa-Beta Kuzatuvchisi va To‘qnashuvgacha Qolgan Vaqt (TTC)</h3>
<p>Kadrlar o‘rtasida obyektlarning traektoriyasi va yaqinlashish tezligi (v<sub>closing</sub> = &minus;d&#775;) <strong>Kalmanning statsionar Alfa-Beta filtri</strong> (&alpha; = 0.5, &beta; = 0.3) yordamida silliqlanadi va to‘qnashuvgacha qolgan vaqt (TTC) baholanadi:</p>

<div class="formula">
    TTC = d / v<sub>closing</sub> , &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Xavf sharti: TTC &lt; 3.5 soniya va |x<sub>lateral</sub>| &le; 1.4 metr
</div>

<h2>3. AVTONOM SQLITE3 MA’LUMOTLAR BAZASI ARXITEKTURASI</h2>
<p>Tizim kompyuter va internet o‘chiq bo‘lganda ham to‘liq ishlashi uchun smartfon ichida <strong>SQLite3 v2 (<code>hamroh.db</code>)</strong> relatsion ma’lumotlar bazasi yaratilgan. Foydalanuvchi ilovaning kirish oynasidan ro‘yxatdan o‘tishi bilan hech qanday qo‘shimcha amal bajarilmasdan 2 millisekund ichida avtomatik tarzda <code>drivers</code> jadvaliga (<code>INSERT INTO drivers</code>) yoziladi. Shuningdek, baza <code>poi</code> (radar va maktab hududlari), <code>trip</code> (safarlar), <code>alert_log</code> (AI xavf signallari) va <code>clip</code> (SHA-256 xesh bilan himoyalangan videoregistrator yozuvlari) jadvallarini o‘z ichiga oladi.</p>

